{0 Azure Cosmos DB for OCaml}

An OCaml client for the
{{:https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/rest/api/cosmos-db/}Azure Cosmos DB REST API}.
Pick a backend:

- [azure-cosmos-db-lwt] for applications using Lwt;
- [azure-cosmos-db-eio] for applications using Eio (OCaml 5).

Both expose the same operations through the signature
{{:../azure-cosmos-db-lwt/Cosmos_lwt/Databases/index.html#module-type-S}[Cosmos_lwt.Databases.S]} /
{{:../azure-cosmos-db-eio/Cosmos_eio/Databases/index.html#module-type-S}[Cosmos_eio.Databases.S]}. Examples in this
documentation use Lwt; Eio differences are noted where they matter.

